    "title": "Suspect arrested, victim identified following deadly Chandler-area shooting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KLTV Digital Media Staff ,\n2 days ago CHANDLER, Texas (KLTV) - The Henderson County Sheriff’s Office said a suspect has been arrested after a man died in a shooting Monday night. Deputies said Monday around 8:54 p.m., a shooting was reported near Shady Trail in Westwood Beach, which is south of Chandler. Authorities responded to the scene and found Cory Starnes, 35, lying in the street on Dogwood Trail with gunshot wounds. First responders and witnesses tried to perform “life-saving efforts,” but Starnes died at the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
